{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Your testimonies</b> — Like the heavens recounting the glory of El, for they are more faithful than your other witnesses, being testimonies from among the testimonies of heaven and earth and sea; therefore he added מאד (\"very\"). The meaning: for the testimonies of these awesome, faithful ones and your testimonies are more so." "And the meaning of <b>to your house</b> — for it corresponds to the Throne of Glory on high, the place of our sanctuary from of old." "<b>For length of days</b> — because the Throne of Glory stands forever; or it is the prayer of the psalmist that the house of HaShem be prolonged many days."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 93, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:07.836088358Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}